      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃剩的东西，吃剩的东西。\n也许宝可梦都喜欢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5403526976844E1C897FFF0C5403526976844E1C897F3002000A4E5F8BB85B9D53EF68A690FD559C6B22FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是个认真的服务生。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n为了杜绝食品浪费，我要告诉你\n吃剩的东西是很有用的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F4E2A8BA4771F7684670D52A1751F300200100001BE01000A4E3A4E86675C7EDD98DF54C16D6A8D39FF0C62118981544A8BC94F60000A5403526976844E1C897F662F5F88670975287684FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位不小心和我搭上话的客人！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n来和携带吃剩的东西的\n宝可梦们对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D4E0D5C0F5FC3548C6211642D4E0A8BDD76845BA24EBAFF0100100001BE01000A6765548C643A5E265403526976844E1C897F7684000A5B9D53EF68A64EEC5BF962185427FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是准备好对战了，\n就来和我说一声吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F51C65907597D5BF962184E86FF0C000A5C316765548C62118BF44E0058F05427FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要和携带吃剩的东西的\n宝可梦们对战吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981548C643A5E265403526976844E1C897F7684000A5B9D53EF68A64EEC5BF962185417FF1F001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF96218FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吃剩的东西有多厉害，\n你不对战试一下就体会不到哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5403526976844E1C897F6709591A53895BB3FF0C000A4F604E0D5BF962188BD54E004E0B5C314F534F1A4E0D523054E63002001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦们\n要是在对战中吃起了东西，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你就当作是萌点，包容一下吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A64EEC000A8981662F57285BF962184E2D54038D774E864E1C897FFF0C00100001BE00000A4F605C315F534F5C662F840C70B9FF0C53055BB94E004E0B5427FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算是携带了吃剩的东西，\n该输的时候还是会输啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B97662F643A5E264E865403526976844E1C897FFF0C000A8BE58F93768465F650198FD8662F4F1A8F93554AFF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "给你新的吃剩的东西！\n虽然这么说很怪。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ED94F6065B076845403526976844E1C897FFF01000A867D71368FD94E488BF45F88602A3002001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让宝可梦携带吃剩的东西后，\n它的HP每隔一段时间就会回复！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n而且在战斗中吃起东西来会很可爱吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA95B9D53EF68A6643A5E265403526976844E1C897F540EFF0C000A5B837684004800506BCF96944E006BB565F695F45C314F1A56DE590DFF0100100001BE01000A800C4E145728621865974E2D54038D774E1C897F67654F1A5F8853EF72315427FF01001000020114014B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！\n我发现了一个不得了的事……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
